n begin="00:25.401" end="00:25.733">care </span><span begin="00:25.733" end="00:26.056">where </span><span begin="00:26.056" end="00:26.402">you </span><span begin="00:26.402" end="00:26.783">think </span><span begin="00:26.783" end="00:27.169">you've </span><span begin="00:27.169" end="00:27.556">been</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.264" end="00:30.723"><span begin="00:27.264" end="00:27.940">And </span><span begin="00:27.940" end="00:28.240">how </span><span begin="00:28.240" end="00:28.585">you're </span><span begin="00:28.585" end="00:28.938">getting </span><span begin="00:28.938" end="00:30.723">over</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.423" end="00:33.404"><span begin="00:30.423" end="00:31.114">If </span><span begin="00:31.114" end="00:31.514">you </span><span begin="00:31.514" end="00:31.900">think </span><span begin="00:31.900" end="00:32.232">you've </span><span begin="00:32.232" end="00:32.589">got </span><span begin="00:32.589" end="00:32.994">me </span><span begin="00:32.994" end="00:33.401">found</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.104" end="00:35.206"><span begin="00:33.104" end="00:33.726">Just </span><span begin="00:33.726" end="00:34.034">wait </span><span begin="00:34.034" end="00:34.366">it </span><span begin="00:34.366" end="00:34.561">gets </span><span begin="00:34.561" end="00:34.712">much </span><span begin="00:34.712" end="00:35.198">colder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.906" end="00:39.385"><span begin="00:34.906" end="00:36.690">Here </span><span begin="00:36.690" end="00:37.760">i </span><span begin="00:37.760" end="00:39.383">am</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.085" end="00:43.384"><span begin="00:39.085" end="00:40.100">As </span><span begin="00:40.100" end="00:40.486">perfect </span><span begin="00:40.486" end="00:40.753">as </span><span begin="00:40.753" end="00:41.202">i'm </span><span begin="00:41.202" end="00:41.380">ever </span><span begin="00:41.380" end="00:42.920">gonna </span><span begin="00