6" end="01:04.414">mean </span><span begin="01:04.414" end="01:04.736">to </span><span begin="01:04.736" end="01:04.907">say </span><span begin="01:04.907" end="01:05.915">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.619" end="01:07.900"><span begin="01:05.619" end="01:06.112">I'm </span><span begin="01:06.112" end="01:06.343">mixed </span><span begin="01:06.343" end="01:07.214">up so </span><span begin="01:07.214" end="01:07.898">what</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.600" end="01:11.631"><span begin="01:07.600" end="01:09.463">Yea </span><span begin="01:09.463" end="01:09.902">you </span><span begin="01:09.902" end="01:10.234">want </span><span begin="01:10.234" end="01:10.605">me </span><span begin="01:10.605" end="01:10.918">so </span><span begin="01:10.918" end="01:11.059">you're </span><span begin="01:11.059" end="01:11.201">messed </span><span begin="01:11.201" end="01:11.445">up </span><span begin="01:11.445" end="01:11.624">too</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.331" end="01:13.339"><span begin="01:11.331" end="01:11.816">I </span><span begin="01:11.816" end="01:12.055">love </span><span begin="01:12.055" end="01:13.023">you i </span><span begin="01:13.023" end="01:13.188">hate </span><span begin="01:13.188" end="01:13.333">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.039" end="01:16.727"><span begin="01:13.039" end="01:14.785">If </span><span begin="01:14.785" end="01:15.088">you </span><span begin="01:15.088" end="01:15.739">only </span><span begin="01:15.739" end="01:16.040">knew </span><span begin="01:16.040" end="01:16.214">what </span><span begin="01:16.214" end="01:16.401">i've </span><span begin="01:16.401" end="01:16.562">been </span><span begin="01:16.562" end="01:16.720">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.427" end="01:21.386"><span begin="01:16.427" end="01:17.744">My </span><span begin="01:17.744" end="01:18.095">head </span><span begin="01:18.095" end="01:18.427">is </span><span begin="01:18.427" end="01:18.823">spin